flowchart TD
    Start([User selects<br/>publication]) --> Pub[GET /api/publications/current<br/>list_publications]
    Pub --> Form[Form blocks:]

    Form --> Geo[GeographyCard<br/>spatial + coordinates]
    Form --> Coll[CollectionEventCard<br/>collection parameters]
    Form --> Tax[TaxonomyCard<br/>taxonomic classification]
    Form --> Quan[QuantitiesCard<br/>quantitative chars]
    Form --> Art[ArticleSourceCard<br/>publication info]

    Geo --> Auto{Autosave?}
    Coll --> Auto
    Tax --> Auto
    Quan --> Auto
    Art --> Auto

    Auto -->|2s debounce| Save[PUT /api/records/id<br/>submission_type=autosave]
    Auto -->|Manual save| Save

    Save --> Validate[validate_record<br/>5 rule modules]
    Validate --> Type{Determine type:}

    Type -->|No errors + autosave| CK[CHECK_OK]
    Type -->|Has errors + autosave| CF[CHECK_FAIL]
    Type -->|No errors + submit| OK[REC_OK]
    Type -->|Has errors + submit| FL[REC_FAIL]

    CK --> Sidebar[View in FormSidebar<br/>per-publication list]
    CF --> Sidebar
    OK --> Sidebar
    FL --> Sidebar

    OK --> Export[Export: XLSX via<br/>GET /api/records/export<br/>GET /api/records/export-all]
    CK --> Export
